# System Architecture

> Last updated: 2026-05-14

## Overview

Tra Cuu Lua Dao is a multi-source scam investigation platform. Users submit phone numbers, bank account numbers, or URLs, and the system queries multiple Vietnamese anti-scam sources, synthesizes findings with LLM-powered agents, and returns a narrative detective report with a risk score -- all streamed in real-time via SSE into a single-column investigation feed.

The system consists of two layers:
- **Backend** (Rust + Axum) -- investigation pipeline, scrapers, LLM agents, cache
- **Frontend** (SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5 + Tailwind CSS 4) -- narrative SSE consumer, investigation UI

## High-Level Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────┐        ┌──────────────────────────┐
│   Frontend (SSR)     │        │   Backend (Rust/Axum)     │
│                      │        │                           │
│  SvelteKit 2         │◄─────SSE│  /api/investigate        │
│                      │◄─────SSE│  /api/investigate/report │
│  Svelte 5 (runes)    │  HTTP   │  - Scraper Pool          │
│  Tailwind CSS 4      │        │  - LLM Agents             │
│  adapter-node        │        │  - PostgreSQL Cache       │
│  Report replay SSE   │        │  - Redis report store     │
│  DOMPurify + marked  │        │                           │
│  Narrative stream UI │        │                           │
└─────────────────────┘        └──────────────────────────┘
         │
         │ (dev: Vite proxy :5167 -> :3067)
         │ (prod: same-origin / reverse proxy required)
