## Backend Architecture

### Technology Stack

| Component       | Technology              |
|----------------|-------------------------|
| Runtime         | Rust 2024 edition       |
| HTTP Framework  | Axum 0.8                |
| Async Runtime   | Tokio                   |
| Database        | PostgreSQL (via sqlx 0.8) |
| Report Buffer   | Redis Streams             |
| HTTP Client     | reqwest / rquest (optional TLS impersonation) |
| SSE Streaming   | axum `Sse` + `async-stream` |
| Logging         | tracing + tracing-subscriber |

### Module Structure

```
src/
├── main.rs              # Entry point, Tokio runtime, Axum server
├── api/
│   ├── mod.rs           # Router, AppState, CORS layer
│   ├── health.rs        # GET /health
│   └── investigate.rs   # GET /api/investigate (SSE)
├── pipeline/
│   ├── mod.rs           # Public exports
│   ├── investigation.rs # 5-phase investigation orchestrator
│   ├── state.rs         # Investigation, InvestigationEvent, QueryType
│   └── url_fetcher.rs   # Page content fetching
├── scrapers/
│   ├── mod.rs           # SourceName, ScrapedResult, run_all_scrapers
│   ├── checkscam.rs     # checkscam.vn scraper
│   ├── chongluadao.rs   # chongluadao.com scraper
│   ├── tinnhiemmang.rs  # tinnhiemmang.com scraper
│   ├── trangtrang.rs    # trangtrang.net scraper
│   ├── google.rs        # Google search scraper (with proxy support)
│   ├── duckduckgo.rs    # DuckDuckGo fallback scraper
│   ├── http_client.rs   # HttpClientFactory (reqwest / rquest)
│   └── proxy.rs         # ProxyPool (socks/http rotation)
├── agents/
│   ├── mod.rs           # Public exports
│   ├── config.rs        # AgentRegistry, ModelConfig, PromptConfig
│   ├── llm_client.rs    # LlmClient (Qwen JSON + streaming)
│   ├── prompt.rs        # Prompt templates, few-shot loading
│   └── hot_reload.rs    # TOML config file watcher
├── cache/
│   ├── mod.rs           # CacheService (PostgreSQL, TTL cleanup)
├── config.rs            # AppConfig (from env)
└── error.rs             # AppError, AppResult
```

### Investigation Pipeline (5 Phases)

```
Phase 1: Thu thập dữ liệu (Data Collection)
  └─ Run all scrapers in parallel (checkscam, chongluadao, tinnhiemmang,
     trangtrang, google) with 10s timeout per scraper.
  └─ DuckDuckGo as fallback if Google fails.
  └─ Cache hit check before each scrape.

Phase 2: Tóm tắt nguồn (Source Summarization)
  └─ "summarizer" agent parses scraped content per source.
  └─ Max 4 concurrent LLM calls (Semaphore).
  └─ Outputs: key_facts, phone_mentions, risk_signals.

Phase 3: Chọn URL điều tra sâu (URL Selection)
  └─ "url-assessor" agent selects top URLs from search results.
  └─ Up to 5 URLs selected by priority/relevance.
  └─ Fallback: first 5 search results if LLM fails.

Phase 4: Phân tích URL (URL Deep Analysis)
  └─ "extractor" agent fetches and analyzes each selected URL.
  └─ Outputs: entities, risk_signals, related_numbers.

Phase 5: Tổng hợp điều tra (Detective Report)
  └─ "detective" agent synthesizes all data into markdown report.
  └─ Report chunk stream is buffered into Redis Streams while the model is generating.
  └─ Main investigation SSE withholds report text until the process flow is complete.
  └─ Frontend opens a second SSE connection to replay the buffered report by `investigation_id`.
  └─ Fallback: deterministic risk scoring from collected signals.
  └─ Final line: RISK_LEVEL + CONFIDENCE parsed from output.
```

### API Endpoints

| Method | Path                | Description              |
|--------|---------------------|--------------------------|
| GET    | `/health`           | Health check             |
| GET    | `/api/investigate`  | SSE investigation stream |
| GET    | `/api/investigate/report` | SSE replay of buffered report |

**`GET /api/investigate`** Query Parameters:
- `q` (required): search query (phone, bank account, or URL)
- `type` (optional): `phone` | `bank` | `url` (default: `phone`)

**SSE Event Types:**

| Event             | Payload                              | Description                |
|-------------------|--------------------------------------|----------------------------|
| `investigation_started` | `{investigation_id}`            | Stable session id for replay |
| `phase_start`     | `{phase, label, total_sources?}`     | Investigation phase began  |
| `source_status`   | `{source, status, found}`            | Scraper completion status  |
| `progress`        | `{phase, message}`                   | Human-readable progress    |
| `summary_result`  | `{source, result: AgentSummary}`     | Per-source summary         |
| `url_assessment`  | `{selected, total, urls}`            | URL selection result       |
| `extraction_result`| `{url, result: AgentExtraction}`    | Deep URL analysis result   |
| `detective_stream`| `{chunk, done, replace}`            | Buffered report chunk or replacement |
| `complete`        | `{investigation_id, risk_level, confidence, sources_analyzed, duration_ms}` | Final result |
| `investigation_error` | `{phase?, message, recoverable}` | Recoverable or terminal error |

### Cache Layer (PostgreSQL)

Three cache tables with TTL-based expiration:

| Table                | Key                                  | Purpose                        |
|----------------------|--------------------------------------|--------------------------------|
| `scrape_cache`       | (query_type, query, source)          | Raw scraper results (24h TTL) |
| `analysis_cache`     | (query, agent_name, prompt_hash, input_hash) | LLM agent outputs (1h TTL) |
| `investigation_cache`| (query_type, query, prompt_hash)     | Full investigation results (1h TTL) |

Background cleanup task runs every 6 hours.

### Query Types

| Type   | Scrapers Activated                                   |
|--------|------------------------------------------------------|
| phone  | CheckScam, TinNhiemMang, ChongLuaDao, TrangTrang, Google (+ DuckDuckGo fallback) |
| bank   | CheckScam, TinNhiemMang, Google (+ DuckDuckGo fallback) |
| url    | CheckScam, TinNhiemMang, Google (+ DuckDuckGo fallback) |

### LLM Agents

| Agent          | Endpoint     | Purpose                                   |
|----------------|--------------|-------------------------------------------|
| summarizer     | Qwen 3.5     | Parse scraped content into structured summary |
| url-assessor   | Qwen 3.5     | Select most relevant URLs for deep analysis |
| extractor      | Qwen 3.5     | Extract entities and signals from page content |
| detective      | Qwen 3.6     | Synthesize final investigation report (streamed) |

Agent configs are TOML files in `config/agents/` with hot-reload support.

